<% provide(:title, 'Help') %>
<h1>Help</h1>

<div class="col-xs-10 col-md-8">
  <h2 style="color:#0A8E42">Getting Started</h2>

  <h3 style="margin:2em">- Creating an account</h3>
  <p>
    <font size="4">
      From the iFarmPro home page, click the "Sign up now!" button to begin the
      process of creating a company.
    </font>
    
    <%= image_tag("HomePage.png", alt: "HomePage") %>
  </p><br><br>
  
  <p>
    <font size="4">
      At the sign up page you will find a submission form requiring a company
      name, an associated email, and a password with password confirmation.  
      Please ensure that you have access to the email address as this will be
      important as you go along.
    </font>
    
    <%= image_tag("SignupPage.png", alt: "SignupPage") %>
  </p><br><br><br>
  
  <h3 style="margin:2em">- Email Confirmation</h3>
  
  <p>
    <font size="4">
      Upon successful sign up you should see an email confirmation page.  Now 
      you need to go to the email you signed up with.  
    </font>
    <%= image_tag("ActivationEmailSent.png", alt: "ActivationEmailSent") %>
    <br>
    
    <font size="4">
      At this point you must verify your email by clicking the link that was 
      emailed to you.  If you did not recieve an email, you may request a new 
      one on the above page. <b><em>Make certain you did not recieve it before
      making a request for a new email to prevent conflicts.</em></b>
    </font>
    <%= image_tag("ActivationEmail.png", alt: "ActivationEmail") %>
    <br>
    
    <font size="4">
      After verifying your email, the confirmation process is complete.
    </font>
  </p>
</div>